Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.36,0:00:09.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Esto es todo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.71,0:00:12.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Eso es todo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.61,0:00:13.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No puede ser, imposible
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.93,0:00:15.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Arriesgué un explosivo\Npor esta mierda!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.75,0:00:17.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}«Explotaron los billetes\Nmarcados con tinta»
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.55,0:00:18.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Espera, ¿qué?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.49,0:00:21.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Perdón?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.13,0:00:23.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Cómo que billetes\Nmarcados?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.75,0:00:25.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Cómo que tinta en el\Ndinero?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.07,0:00:27.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Es en serio?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.55,0:00:30.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Qué significa eso?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.51,0:00:30.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Qué significa?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.03,0:00:31.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Qué me estás diciendo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.99,0:00:32.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Espera...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.13,0:00:36.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Eso explica por qué Lucía\Nestá toda morada
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.63,0:00:38.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Qué carajo! Es cierto,\N¡mira mi cuerpo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.27,0:00:41.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Cómo hago para que no me\Nexploten los billetes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.51,0:00:42.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Estoy tan confundido
